config PON_VIRT
	bool "Virtual PON MAC (QEMU): the GPON ONU core over an Ethernet wire"
	depends on NET && VIRTIO_NET
	select GPON_CORE
	select CRC32
	help
	  The PON MAC of a virtual ONU: the same gpon_* PLOAM, OMCI and GEM
	  core as the boards, carried at frame level over a NIC whose far end
	  is the host's virtual ODN (dev/virt/vodn). The WAN is gpon0. Only
	  for the realtek-*/virt subtargets; no board has this wire.
